#: scenario2:scenario2_1E6C256C_B493_478B_9873_8BF3B45AB41F
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 4010c328978ab022049b73703c645c94200c6644b34e7f83344d6dd9f3cca1ac
#. default-sha256: 1e52a60575c06c02b4c1dbb7df26e9758f28e147d970228c9dd7586518bd3090
msgctxt "scenario2:scenario2_1E6C256C_B493_478B_9873_8BF3B45AB41F"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫Without exception, everyone who had wandered into the mansion "
"had lost their lives before the sun rose the next morning."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫Sem exceção, todos que entraram na mansão perderam suas vidas "
"antes do sol nascer na manhã seguinte."

#: scenario2:scenario2_C93420F3_8FFA_40B7_B856_1FE1F8A0466F
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 27887a8d617a187fe7e0c1e416fb2c977499600122f527ab2fc03e5bcb896c77
#. default-sha256: c8919e43792568d8ae2ead2f3e976d003958bbde3551d9f9fea56bdf9d74704c
msgctxt "scenario2:scenario2_C93420F3_8FFA_40B7_B856_1FE1F8A0466F"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫She was the first visitor who had not met this fate."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫Ela foi a primeira visitante que não teve esse destino."

#: scenario2:scenario2_CAC6C91A_DD29_4811_9238_F2717385F7F9
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: c02a61962112d7716ffbf4db44df55df1f789dfceed6b8df2491cb2025c138ee
#. default-sha256: 0a9f1ed2564200c8b0de30d05a522e2f6275da2a0cfc28bb0e330fc4753a7263
msgctxt "scenario2:scenario2_CAC6C91A_DD29_4811_9238_F2717385F7F9"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Over time, Bestia’s madness gradually subsided; ⟪k:1⟫he even began to seem rather tame. ⟪k:2⟫"
"You would hardly believe it was the same beast who had once reveled in those perverse festivities."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Com o tempo, a loucura de Bestia diminuiu gradualmente; ⟪k:1⟫ele até começou a parecer "
"bastante manso. ⟪k:2⟫Você dificilmente acreditaria que era a mesma fera que uma vez se deleitou "
"com essas festividades perversas."

#: scenario2:scenario2_1D47DDF0_66D0_43BB_9984_D2296BE1DCDC
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 1e5bbbf364bff0a1304dfbfda43922458137e00ccc4ff37ebfbce0607b3e9021
#. default-sha256: c677649a04e45ff5daead1d15a4ba8e6fbbe9970f673a3bc2548c55f30de03b8
msgctxt "scenario2:scenario2_1D47DDF0_66D0_43BB_9984_D2296BE1DCDC"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫He was, I imagine, at a loss for how to behave."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫Ele estava, imagino, sem saber como se comportar."

#: scenario2:scenario2_1FE82314_7A96_4ED8_9B20_9E78C3AB7AA3
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: af92814e6e656bd6dabc3107c9884cd65a6a250aa3f46823f246b60f3091d594
#. default-sha256: 2d598807e4806a70cf0993b48c2660aeb02026bfb9202f50851a06110203c42a
msgctxt "scenario2:scenario2_1FE82314_7A96_4ED8_9B20_9E78C3AB7AA3"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫I too would be flustered in the constant presence of such beauty."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫Eu também ficaria perturbado na presença constante de tamanha beleza."

#: scenario2:scenario2_E0F46256_924E_4B46_9D3D_844EE9C51BC8
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 7efc447b0f06e70c51f0b12532202e12b6889bf1196073a80f4f4d5ca75d3b2b
#. default-sha256: 656b99e18798360ecde8b966c41594df41e9b4c5f16ffc6f34dcefc85a693197
msgctxt "scenario2:scenario2_E0F46256_924E_4B46_9D3D_844EE9C51BC8"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫But it was not just her appearance; ⟪k:1⟫she had said she wished to live with him—⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫"
"a beast who had committed countless atrocities. ⟪k:4⟫Perplexing indeed."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Mas não era apenas sua aparência; ⟪k:1⟫ela havia dito que desejava viver com ele—⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫"
"uma fera que havia cometido inúmeras atrocidades. ⟪k:4⟫De fato, assombroso."

