msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫...O que foi?"

#: scenario2:scenario2_B5BD6D06_AAF2_49FD_BAD8_8B3BA4A5AD55
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 63bbb17fc8fd120c0d09861c4d6ea0260446e5d521b83168d14b3bae8617e16a
