msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Parece que tenho medo de você?"

#: scenario2:scenario2_819774A8_0F00_452F_8CA5_49691425E1DE
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 7d63a35f884464e61fe577a44aac09fd9155e800240ef2ca7c64b6667ee9cbe8
