#: scenario2:scenario2_CF810AEE_F1A6_4B2C_8B58_3FFE098C534E
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: d26782b62433b5a4689822c3d18eab4682a42d26e6d69cb55fe1c069317fbba0
