msgid "⟪k:0⟫(I wanted... ⟪k:1⟫for so long... ⟪k:2⟫to slaughter them...)"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫(Por tanto tempo... ⟪k:1⟫eu desejei... ⟪k:2⟫matá-los...)"

#: scenario2:scenario2_5AA9AE97_F7A2_4AFA_A2FD_3B7BBDA70572
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
