#: scenario2:scenario2_0A5D7881_668B_43CC_85AE_41D744B01457
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 792a93d0e461c4f2e93c8be3b4eff9cefed47b97cad4fcee5d49e08b4541fc29
